@startuml
title Research Worker Workflow (LangChain agent)

start
:Receive in-scope question from LangGraph;
:LLM chooses a keyword query;
:Invoke LangChain retrieval tool;

if (Query matches indexed terms?) then (yes)
    :Search ChromaDB for up to three passages;
    :Filter weak matches;
    :Return passages with citation IDs;
else (no)
    :Return an empty evidence list;
    :LLM may retry once with new keywords;
endif

if (Relevant passages retrieved?) then (yes)
    :LLM writes 1-3 sentence summary,
    each sentence ending with a citation ID;
else (no)
    :LLM replies NO_EVIDENCE (empty draft);
endif

:Return tool results as evidence and the draft to LangGraph;
stop

@enduml
